  "chain": "design did not address known flow-induced vibration [cause B] -> retaining clip loosened (inadequate maintenance instructions) -> braided supply/return hoses rubbed together -> both hoses wore through and failed, leaking nitrogen -> RV-2-02-071K ADS function declared inoperable (>14-day LCO) -> loss of safety function for ADS (4 of 5 valves remained operable)",
