  "notes": "Only the 'K' ADS valve was affected; the other four ADS valves remained operable and are not separately modeled as backups since they are part of the same SB/ADS system, not distinct backup systems. No BACKED_UP_BY edge asserted since no alternate operable system (e.g., RCIC, LPCI) is stated to have covered specifically for this valve's inoperability; the narrative instead describes reduced ADS capacity. The 2016 solenoid-relocation modification is treated as the origin design failure per the cause code B (Design/Manufacturing/Installation), consistent with official cause code overriding narrative's dual design/maintenance framing; maintenance-instruction inadequacy for the clip is captured as a downstream failure mode in the chain, not as a competing cause code."
